title: "Social Isolation and SCD in BRFSS 2023-2024: Interpretable ML Screening"
abstract: >
  XGBoost + SHAP machine learning pipeline for subjective cognitive decline
  screening in U.S. adults aged 50+, using BRFSS 2023-2024 (N=192,567).
  Includes the Modifiable Social Isolation Index (MSII) construction.
